`just` for task automation. One file defines all project commands—no scattered scripts. Cross-platform without extra dependencies. Pin versions in `justfile` to keep builds reproducible.

Bonus: `just --list` shows all commands, replacing manual docs. Works in CI too. Lightweight, fast, and Python-free.

